three-state root-fidelity Holevo bound</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>M. Fannes, F. de Melo, W. Roga and K. Życzkowski, <em>Matrices of fidelities for ensembles of quantum states and the Holevo quantity</em>, arXiv:1104.2271v1, page 10, Conjecture 1:</p>
