<p>For any ensemble E₃ = {(pᵢ, ϱᵢ)} with K = 3 three states of arbitrary dimension d the corresponding Holevo quantity χ(E₃) is bounded from above by the entropy of the matrix C√F(E₃) defined in (16): χ(E₃) ≤ S(C√F(E₃)).</p>
