| Increasing level filtration at every $r$ | <code>level k w = w.countP' (· ≠ k)</code> and <code>filtration k r</code>, the rational span of all words of level at most $r$ |
| Every finite rational polynomial in that span | <code>P : H</code> with membership in <code>filtration k r</code>; no length, weight, homogeneity, coefficient-sign or cancellation restriction |
| Original ari product and dual coproduct | <code>letterAction</code>, <code>primitiveUnshuffle</code>, <code>star</code>, <code>transposeProperty</code>, and the proved uniquely characterized <code>delta</code> |
| Full ordinary pairing | <code>pairing</code>, <code>tensorPairing</code>, <code>delta_transpose</code> and <code>delta_basis_coefficient</code>, including empty words and both unit tensor terms |
| Membership in the actual right-factor tensor image | <code>rightFiltrationImage k r = LinearMap.range (TensorProduct.map id (filtration k r).subtype)</code> and <code>result</code> |</p>
