ion independent of the power index.</p></div><details class="verification-details"><summary>Verification details</summary><article class="news-result" id="thanatipanonda-2014-shifted-binomial-power-linearization"><div class="news-result-meta"><span>Release source record</span><span class="news-status proved">Proved in Lean</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Open problem</p><h3>Thanatipanonda&#x27;s shifted binomial power linearization</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>T. Thanatipanonda, <em>Beyond Zudilin's Conjectured q-analog of Schmidt's
