se source record</span><span class="news-status proved">Proved in Lean</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Open problem</p><h3>The complete graph maximizes the trace of the average mixing matrix</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>Chris Godsil, Krystal Guo and Mariia Sobchuk, <em>Diagonal entries of the
