<p>The exact formal target keeps all source quantifiers: positive <code>m,n</code>, every
<code>N</code> and equivalence <code>e : Fin N ≃ Fin m × Fin n</code> satisfying the reverse
linear-extension condition, and every order-convex initial set <code>I</code>, including
