rd</span><span class="news-status refuted">Refuted in Lean</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Open problem</p><h3>Question 1.10: regular Toeplitz and strictly ergodic strengthening</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>The cited v1 asks whether a given minimal/strictly ergodic (Toeplitz)
