<blockquote>
<p>Suppose that ${y_k}_{k=0}^{\infty}$ is a log-concave sequence. Then the functions $\mu\to\widetilde y(\mu;x)$ and $\mu\to\widehat y(\mu;x)$ are coefficient-wise log-concave on $\mu&gt;0$.</p>
