d infinite commutative monoid</p><p><span>Our contribution</span>One infinite commutative periodic semigroup over Q has algebraic Davenport constant at most one and unbounded relative constants in its actual Green quotient.</p></div><details class="verification-details"><summary>Verification details</summary><article class="news-result" id="wang-conjecture326"><div class="news-result-meta"><span>Release source record</span><span class="news-status refuted">Refuted in Lean</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">arXiv</p><h3>Wang Conjecture 3.26: finite algebraic constant does not bound the relative constants</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>Guoqing Wang, <em>Semigroup rings and algebraically independent sequences with
