<p>| Source clause | Formal counterpart |
| --- | --- |
| every commutative semigroup, including infinite and nonunital ones | <code>S : Type</code>, <code>[AddCommSemigroup S]</code> |
| periodic | <code>Periodic S</code>: each native <code>AddSubsemigroup.closure {a}</code> is finite |
