| every commutative unitary ring | <code>R : Type</code>, <code>[CommRing R]</code>; no field hypothesis |
| ordinary semigroup algebra | upstream <code>AddMonoidAlgebra R S</code>, retaining all labels |
| all independently nonzero positional coefficients | <code>GoodSequence</code>: every <code>c : N -&gt; R</code>, with <code>c i != 0</code> for each occupied position |
| finite algebraic constant | <code>algebraicD S R &lt; top</code>, supremum of finite good lengths |
| actual principal ideals | <code>principalIdeal a = {a} union {a+c : c in S}</code> |
