cord</span><span class="news-status refuted">Refuted in Lean</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">arXiv</p><h3>The negative-index root-amplitude attainment clause is refuted</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>S. R. Mane, <em>Identically vanishing k-generalized Fibonacci polynomials</em>,
