| $d'(G)=a/b$ | Exact integer equation <code>b * classCount = a * latticeCount</code>; the finite lattice and its quotient are both nonempty and have positive counts |
| Every allowed pair | No bounded range, structural restriction, supplied count formula or family-selection hypothesis in the final theorem |</p>
