<p>A004123 COMMENT (Peter Bala, Jul 08 2022):</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Conjecture: Let k be a positive integer. The sequence obtained by reducing a(n) modulo k is eventually periodic with the period dividing phi(k) = A000010(k).</p>
</blockquote>
