em</p><h3>Log-negativity entangling capacity depends on the input resource for CPTP maps</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>E. T. Campbell, <em>Optimal entangling capacity of dynamical processes</em>, Phys. Rev. A <strong>82</strong>, 042314 (2010), arXiv:1007.1445v2, Section VII, p. 7, asks:</p>
