Antibrackets</em>, SIGMA 12 (2016), 053, arXiv:1509.09032v3, Conjecture 2.4:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>For every $n\ge 2$ the coefficients $c^n_i$ of Theorem~{\rm \ref{thm.standardform}} are given by the formula</p>
</blockquote>
<p>$c_i^n=\frac{\displaystyle (-1)^{n} \prod_{j=2}^{i}\dfrac{n(n-1)-(j-1)(j-2)}{2}}{\displaystyle \sum_{h=2}^n h\left(\prod_{j=2}^{h}\dfrac{n(n-1)-(j-1)(j-2)}{2}\right)\left(\prod_{j=h}^{n-1}\dfrac{(1-j)(j+2)}{2}\right)}$,</p>
<blockquote>
