lass="verification-details"><summary>Verification details</summary><article class="news-result" id="groot-nibbelink-2020-four-dimensional-singlet-branching"><div class="news-result-meta"><span>Release source record</span><span class="news-status proved">Proved in Lean</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Open problem</p><h3>Four-dimensional determinant-one representations and cyclic singlets</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>S. Groot Nibbelink, O. Loukas, A. Mütter, E. Parr and P. K. S. Vaudrevange
