ws-status proved">Proved in Lean</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Integer sequences (OEIS)</p><h3>Kurkov&#x27;s A003319 double-array conjecture</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>The source audit for this resolution read the canonical OEIS A003319 entry and
