<p>For sorted positive natural numbers $a\ge b\ge c$ of common parity, the literal source specialization is</p>
<p>$$
F(a,b,c)=\sum_{j=0}^{c}\binom cj\binom b{(b-c)/2+j}\binom a{(a-c)/2+j}.
