$$</p>
<p>The five conventions <code>weight</code>, <code>law</code>, <code>tauW</code>, <code>kappa</code>, <code>claim</code> are literal
to <a href="https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/issues/16825">#16825</a>.
The probability normalization and bounded observable are proved for this
law. Identification of this law with the physical random-matrix model is
the cited mathematical-model premise, rather than a theorem about a
physical cavity's dynamics.</p>
