<li><strong>The SVD entropy.</strong> For |ψ¹⟩, |ψ²⟩ in H_A ⊗ H_B, the reduced transition matrix is τ_A = Tr_B(|ψ¹⟩⟨ψ²|)/⟨ψ²|ψ¹⟩, the SVD density matrix is ρ^{1|2}_A = √(τ_A†τ_A)/Tr √(τ_A†τ_A), and the SVD entanglement entropy is its von Neumann entropy (§2). It lies between 0 and log d_A.</li>
