</ul>
<p>The verbatim statements are in <a href="../Library/Entropy/parzygnat2023svdentropy.md">the literature note</a>.</p>
<p>Issue <a href="https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/issues/16821">#16821</a> fixes the reading: two-qubit pure states as coefficient matrices of Frobenius norm 1, the unnormalized transition Tr_B|ψ⟩⟨φ| (the factor 1/⟨φ|ψ⟩ cancels in the SVD density matrix, so orthogonal pairs with nonzero transition are included), and natural-logarithm entropies. The bound is proved for every such pair.</p>
