e left multiplier.</p></div><details class="verification-details"><summary>Verification details</summary><article class="news-result" id="garcia-marco-2025-uniform-toeplitz-factorization"><div class="news-result-meta"><span>Release source record</span><span class="news-status refuted">Refuted in Lean</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Open problem</p><h3>The uniform single-left-multiplier Toeplitz factorization assertion</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>Ignacio García-Marco, Irene Márquez-Corbella and Daniel Seco, <em>On the minimum number of Toeplitz factors of a matrix</em>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.16432v1">arXiv:2506.16432v1</a>, Section 5.2, Conjecture 5.1, original archive <code>Toeplitz-GMS.tex</code>, lines 1170–1175 (<code>super-conjecture</code>), states:</p>
