l unitarily invariant norms.</p></div><details class="verification-details"><summary>Verification details</summary><article class="news-result" id="zhang-li-2026-rank-one-hadamard-product-variational"><div class="news-result-meta"><span>Release source record</span><span class="news-status proved">Proved in Lean</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Open problem</p><h3>Zhang–Li rank-one Hadamard product variational problem</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>Lei-Hong Zhang and Ren-Cang Li, <em>On a Conjecture Related to Eigenvalue
