se source record</span><span class="news-status refuted">Refuted in Lean</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Open problem</p><h3>The C*-algebraic Schoenberg Conjecture is false</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>K. Mahesh Krishna, &quot;C*-algebraic Schoenberg Conjecture&quot;, arXiv:2206.06653v1 (14 June 2022; single version), Section 2. The source text is quoted verbatim:</p>
