and
$$\sum_{k=1}^{d-1}b_k^*b_k\leq \frac{1}{d^2}\left[\sum_{j=1}^{d}a_j\right]^*\left[\sum_{j=1}^{d}a_j\right]+ \frac{d-2}{d}\sum_{j=1}^{d}a_j^*a_j.$$</p>
</blockquote>
