subspace of dimension three is always achievable&quot;, and in their conclusion that &quot;it is unclear
why&quot; this happens. The verbatim definitions and statements are in
<a href="../Library/QuantumStates/cepollaro2025stabilizer.md">the literature note</a>.</p>
<p>Issue <a href="https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/issues/13822">#13822</a> reads a
