<blockquote>
<p>A Jacobi matrix $J$ realizes \textbf{perfect state transfer} (PST) between the end-vertices of the weighted path in Figure \ref{fig:nearestneighbor} at time $T &gt; 0$ if $e^{-iJT}\e_0 = e^{i\phi}\e_N$ for some phase $\phi \in \R$.</p>
