</blockquote>
<p>Issue #11228 fixes the reading: <code>Â</code> is identified with <code>ℤ_N × ℤ_N</code> through
the dot product, the symmetries are the invertible 4 × 4 matrices over
<code>ZMod N</code> preserving <code>Q(a, â) = a·â</code>, <code>β</code> is the upper-right 2 × 2 block, and a
β-invertible <code>S₃</code> is a homomorphism <code>ρ : S₃ → GL₄(ZMod N)</code> into these
symmetries with <code>det β(ρ g)</code> a unit for every <code>g ≠ 1</code>. Only this group-theoretic
