<p>The identification of <code>frobChar</code> with the ordinary irreducible character is the classical Frobenius formula, attested through the source's Lemma 3.1 and Stanley's Corollary 7.17.4. This representation-theoretic identification is a literature input, not a Lean construction of representations or Specht modules. The public definitions retain the preregistered coefficient conventions, with the polynomial-first coefficient API.</p>
