| Every element acts noninvertibly | <code>claim</code>: nonunit hypothesis for every action |
| Some positive tensor power contains the null representation as an actual direct summand | <code>HasNullSummand</code> and the first conjunct of <code>claim</code>; complementary subspace is invariant |
