page encloses each residue summand as <code>(a^i mod m)</code> in the same typography.</p>
<p>With the printed bracketing, the proved statement is: for every positive natural
number <code>a</code> and every prime natural number <code>m</code> coprime to <code>a</code>, if the
multiplicative order of <code>a</code> modulo <code>m</code> is even, then</p>
<pre><code class="language-text">Sum_{i=1}^{ord_m(a)} ((2*a^i + m) mod (2*m)) = m*ord_m(a).
</code></pre>
