</blockquote>
<p>The quantified statement ranges over every finite graph on Fin n, every real coupling vector, every simplicial clique, every positive γ, and every complex root. The shared-root exclusion ranges over all complex x. Neither nonzero individual couplings nor simple roots are assumed.</p>
