<p>D_G^A is the normalized one-sided geometric discord, d/(d − 1) times the least squared Hilbert–Schmidt distance between ρ and its image under a projective measurement of A. C_M is the maximal mutual correlation, the supremum of |ω_ρ(ab) − ω_ρ(a) ω_ρ(b)| over local elements of norm 1. Both definitions are quoted in <a href="../Library/QuantumContext/gwozdz2014discordspontaneous.md">the literature note</a>.</p>
