rtificate proves</p><p><span>Scope &amp; next question</span>The settlement supplies the previously conjectural triplewise ingredient; it does not formalize the pairwise criterion. - Neighbouring questions and Bell nonlocality.</p></div><details class="verification-details"><summary>Verification details</summary><article class="news-result" id="yadavalli-andrejic-kunjwal-2024-biased-trine-joint-measurability"><div class="news-result-meta"><span>Release source record</span><span class="news-status proved">Proved in Lean</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Open problem</p><h3>The exact triplewise joint-measurability threshold of biased trine qubit measurements</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>S. A. Yadavalli, N. Andrejic and R. Kunjwal, <em>Qualitative equivalence between incompatibility and Bell nonlocality</em>, arXiv:2008.10100v3; Phys. Rev. A 110, L060201 (2024), Supplemental Material, Section III, Example 1. Its TeX source <code>qualequiv_supp_arxiv.tex</code>, lines 151–158, states:</p>
