<p>The parameter domain is $-1\leq b\leq1$, $0\leq\eta\leq1$ and $|b|\leq1-\eta$. Triplewise joint measurability means the existence of eight positive semidefinite complex $2\times2$ matrices $G_s$, indexed by $s\in{-1,+1}^3$, such that $\sum_sG_s=I$ and $\sum_{s:s_k=x}G_s=E_k(x)$ for every $k$ and $x$.</p>
