cle class="news-result" id="oeis-a018800-least-prime-prefix-suffix-refutation"><div class="news-result-meta"><span>Release source record</span><span class="news-status refuted">Refuted in Lean</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Integer sequences (OEIS)</p><h3>Refutation of the A018800 least-prime prefix suffix-bound conjecture</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>OEIS A018800, NAME (verbatim):</p>
