r every number K &gt;= 2 of measurement outcomes, the deterministic expression in (B1) has minimum 6(K-1).</p><p><span>Scope &amp; next question</span>The facet-defining property, quantum optimum, and visibility optimum are outside the result.</p></div><details class="verification-details"><summary>Verification details</summary><article class="news-result" id="grandjean-liang-bancal-brunner-gisin-2012-sliwa-seven-local-bound"><div class="news-result-meta"><span>Release source record</span><span class="news-status proved">Proved in Lean</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Open problem</p><h3>The local-bound clause of the Grandjean et al. conjecture on (B1)</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>B. Grandjean, Y.-C. Liang, J.-D. Bancal, N. Brunner and N. Gisin,
