<blockquote>
<p>In this note, we investigate some properties of the two-parameter generalized
Pascal triangle M^{(m)}(a, b) given by the Riordan array
M^{(m)}(a, b) = ( 1/(1 − ax) , x(1 + bx)/(1 − ax)^m ).</p>
