<code>forall q : Nat, q.Prime -&gt; ((Nat.Prime (Q q - 4) and Nat.Prime (Q q - 2) and Nat.Prime (Q q + 2) and Nat.Prime (Q q + 4)) iff q = 3)</code>.</p>
