ails"><summary>Verification details</summary><article class="news-result" id="quinta-andre-burchardt-zyczkowski-2019-m-resistant-states"><div class="news-result-meta"><span>Release source record</span><span class="news-status proved">Proved in Lean</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Open problem</p><h3>M-resistant qudit states exist for every admissible loss parameter</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>Quinta, André, Burchardt and Życzkowski, <em>Cut-resistant links and multipartite entanglement resistant to particle loss</em>, Phys. Rev. A 100, 062329 (2019), arXiv:1908.10390v1, Section V, state:</p>
