ure</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>R. Sun, Z.-Q. Luo, and Y. Ye, <em>On the efficiency of random permutation for ADMM and coordinate descent</em>, arXiv:1503.06387v3, Section 3.3, Conjecture 3.1, equation (37), PDF p.20, state:</p>
