<blockquote>
<p>While we provide a complete characterization of the sequences that minimize input entropy, the precise identification of the sequences that maximize input entropy for the 2-deletion and 2-insertion channels is still unresolved. Determining these sequences and the associated maximal entropy values remains an important open direction.</p>
