\prod_{i=1}^{m}\left[\mathcal O(x)^{V_{i*}}
+\varepsilon_i\mathcal O(y)^{V_{i*}}\right]
,d\mu(x),d\mu(y) \ge 0.
$$</p>
<p>The Lean <code>claim</code> retains these quantifiers and the literal duplicated
integral. Its evenness premise is inline: <code>parity p (fun e =&gt; (u e : ℤ)) = 0</code>.
