ment prose"><p>J. Bhanja, <em>Sumsets with a minimum number of distinct terms</em>, Integers 25
(2025), A12, arXiv:2307.03977v2, §4 “Further Remarks”, printed p. 11:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Another sumset that may come immediately to the reader’s mind is the sumset
