s="eyebrow">Open problem</p><h3>ellis thanatipanonda 2022 cut family a conjecture 1</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>Paul Ellis and Thotsaporn Aek Thanatipanonda, <em>The Arithmetic-Periodicity
