Conjecture 6.2:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>The inequality (1.6) holds for all r ∈ (0, 1) and a ∈ (0, ∞) if and only if b ∈ (0, √(a(a+1))], and the inequality (1.7) holds for all r ∈ (0, 1) if and only if a ∈ [3/7, 1).</p>
