<p>For ordinary mathematical rendering, the literal <code>\\newline</code> separators in that immutable transcription mean row breaks. Thus the determinants have rows (x,y) and (x,y,z), respectively, and increasing coordinate columns. No statement is changed by that typographic reading.</p>
