lynomial expansion of its principal Hamiltonian over every algebraically closed field of characteristic zero.</p></div><details class="verification-details"><summary>Verification details</summary><article class="news-result" id="poncini-rasmussen-2022-transfer-expansion-conjecture-c12"><div class="news-result-meta"><span>Release source record</span><span class="news-status proved">Proved in Lean</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Open problem</p><h3>The Poncini–Rasmussen central factorial transfer expansion</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>Poncini and Rasmussen, <em>Integrability of planar-algebraic models</em>, arXiv:2206.14462v2, Appendix C, page 47, state Conjecture C.12:</p>
