</blockquote>
<p>The detailed displays at lines 431–432 and Figure 6 caption at line 474 select $S-K$. The summary at line 133 instead says $K-S$; this conflict is retained. Line 424 uses $a=A/N$ asymptotically. Line 417 conditions the analytic evaluation on the proposed topology, and line 792 explicitly calls the topology numerical/conjectural. The universal statement above imposes no such topology hypothesis.</p>
