<p>The wording and equation are quoted from the downloaded v2 source (<code>J_shaping.tex</code>, md5 <code>3c751c31a7a40505b6013390b841878a</code>); its macros for the gate, $\mathrm{Sym}_0$, $\mathbb R$ and the norm are expanded for rendering. The source also states, at line 349:</p>
