$n$ when $k\ge m-1$. Each threshold may depend on $m$ and $k$.
The settlement is <strong>Refuted</strong>, specifically for the v1 statement.
The preregistration is <a href="https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/issues/19687">#19687</a>.</p>
