 class="news-result-meta"><span>Release source record</span><span class="news-status refuted">Refuted in Lean</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">arXiv</p><h3>Same-phase periodic SSH ground states can have positive averaged excess pseudo entropy</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>P. K. Kharel, M. Limbu, N. Khatri, A. Khanal and K. Adhikari, <em>Pseudo entropy and topological phases of matter</em>, arXiv:2606.29311v1, test the conjectured sign of the averaged excess pseudo entropy in the Su–Schrieffer–Heeger model.</p>
