>Hyperbolic EGF coefficients have residue one at every power of two.</p></div><details class="verification-details"><summary>Verification details</summary><article class="news-result" id="tebni364822-power-of-two-cong"><div class="news-result-meta"><span>Release source record</span><span class="news-status proved">Proved in Lean</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Integer sequences (OEIS)</p><h3>Tebni&#x27;s power-of-two congruence for OEIS A364822</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>M. Tebni's OEIS <a href="https://oeis.org/A364822">A364822</a>, revision 25, names the sequence:</p>
