s"><summary>Verification details</summary><article class="news-result" id="mukherjee-ganguly-2025-non-unital-network-condition-implication"><div class="news-result-meta"><span>Release source record</span><span class="news-status proved">Proved in Lean</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Open problem</p><h3>The non-unital channel conditions imply both network bounds</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>K. Mukherjee and N. Ganguly, <em>Network nonlocality breaking channels</em>, arXiv:2510.26417v1 (2025), Section IV.B, <code>Network_Nonlocality.tex</code>, lines 733–734:</p>
