<p>The quotations retain the source's TeX reference labels. The corresponding PDF passage is on page 12; <code>nu3</code> is Eq. (6), <code>resnon1</code> is Eq. (38), and <code>nu1</code>, <code>nu2</code> are Eqs. (4), (5). The source TeX has MD5 <code>6bb7806236c7d6b0bcaa73d3eed0bc28</code>.</p>
<p>Issue <a href="https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/issues/20159">#20159</a> fixes the statement to be settled: for every real $t,\lambda_1,\lambda_3$, the three conditions</p>
