are signed inhomogeneities $\theta_i\in{\kappa,-\kappa}$ and $c\ne0$
such that $M_\pi=c,t(\kappa;\theta)$. Whenever the transfer matrices
$t(u;\theta)$ commute pairwise, $M_\pi$ commutes with every $t(u;\theta)$.
