<ul>
<li>(C.1) $a(N)$ is a square if and only if $4\nmid N$.</li>
<li>(C.2) $5\nmid a(2n+1)$.</li>
<li>(C.3) $v_5(a(4n))=2b(n)$.</li>
<li>(C.4) $v_5(a(4n+2))=2b(n+1)$.</li>
</ul>
