including zero. The valuation agrees with <a href="https://oeis.org/A112765/internal">A112765</a>
on positive arguments. The source, conventions and literature screen are in
<a href="https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/issues/21915">preregistration #21915</a>.</p>
