</code></pre>
<p>Only the Conjecture line is settled for the recurrence interpretation,
covering every <code>n &gt;= 1</code> and also <code>n=0</code>. The Lucas representation, the
5-adic limit (A269591), and A268922 are not claimed. The formal definition
does not use Lucas numbers.</p>
