Mats Granvik's OEIS A192763 COMMENTS field states:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>The main diagonal is the Mobius function times the natural numbers A055615 (conjecture). For k&gt;1 the first row is the Mertens function + 2 = A002321 + 2 (conjecture).</p>
