<blockquote>
<p>Let $(A_q)$ and $(A'_q)$ be asymptotically strictly decreasing sequences of sets of integers such that $A'_q=sA_q+t$ for all $q\in\mathbb N$ and some $s,t\in\mathbb Z$ with $s\notin{0,\pm1}$. Does this imply $H(A_q)=H(A'_q)$?</p>
