y><div class="reading-item-body"><div class="result-story-expanded"><p><span>The question</span>Hanna&#x27;s OEIS A352700 (revision 7, March 31, 2022; unpaginated), NAME, defines the sequence by:</p><p><span>Our contribution</span>Lagrange substitution and Frobenius pairing prove Hanna&#x27;s six A352700 congruences.</p></div><details class="verification-details"><summary>Verification details</summary><article class="news-result" id="oeis-a352700-hanna-catalan-congruences"><div class="news-result-meta"><span>Release source record</span><span class="news-status proved">Proved in Lean</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Integer sequences (OEIS)</p><h3>Hanna&#x27;s OEIS A352700 Catalan power-series and modular-coefficient conjectures</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>Paul D. Hanna's <a href="https://oeis.org/A352700">OEIS A352700</a> (revision <code>#7</code>, March 31, 2022; unpaginated), NAME, defines the sequence by:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>G.f.: Sum_{n&gt;=0} binomial((n+1)*(2*n+1),n)/(2*n+1) * x^n / C(x)^(n*(2*n+1)+1), where C(x) = 1 + x*C(x)^2 is the Catalan function (A000108).</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Its COMMENTS state the six numbered conjectures:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Conjectures: given g.f. A(x), let C(x) = (1 - sqrt(1-4*x))/(2*x) be the Catalan power series (A000108), then
(1) A(x)^3 = A(x^3) (mod 3),
(2) A(x) = C(x) + x^2*C(x)^3 (mod 3) = (2 - x)*C(x) - 1 (mod 3),
(3) A(x) = C(x) (mod 2),
(4) a(n) = binomial(2*n+1,n)/(2*n+1) + 3*binomial(2*n-1,n-2)/(2*n-1) (mod 3) for n &gt;= 0,
(5) a(n) = 2*A000108(n) - A000108(n-1)  (mod 3) for n &gt;= 1,
(6) a(n) = A000108(n) (mod 2) for n &gt;= 0.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>The published OFFSET is <code>0,3</code>. Its EXAMPLE field records the coefficient expansion of $C(x) + x^2 C(x)^3$, under which the second term $3\binom{2n-1}{n-2}/(2n-1)$ vanishes for $n &lt; 2$ by the negative-lower-index binomial convention $\binom{2n-1}{n-2} = 0$, and its PARI PROG defines $a(n)$ by the finite degree-$n$ truncation over $0 \le m \le n$. The <a href="../Library/RecurrenceComposition/hanna2022a352700.md">Library note</a> records the source and exact integer divisibility of each weight and Raney quotient. Preregistration: <a href="https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/issues/23834">#23834</a>.</p>
