-common-Zeckendorf-term greedy sequence is a permutation</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>This dossier anchors exactly the OEIS A370630 conjecture: “Conjecture: this
sequence is a permutation of the positive integers.” The record title is
“Lexicographically earliest sequence of distinct positive integers such that the
