<p>Due to the definition of strong complementarity each pair of matrices has non-zero entries in different places, so that $k \leq n$. We are not able to determine how the maximal number $k$ of such matrices depends on the dimension $n$, nor whether the bistochastic matrices belonging to the interior of this polytope are unistochastic.</p>
