</blockquote>
<p>This is lines 1237–1241. The settled qutrit reading is the assertion that every completely positive trace-preserving qutrit map that is divisible and outside the formal <code>pDivisibleSet</code> is entanglement breaking. The module names this assertion <code>claim</code>.</p>
