ss="eyebrow">Integer sequences (OEIS)</p><h3>Rotondo&#x27;s A006972 Lucas-Carmichael sufficient condition</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>OEIS A006972, NAME (<code>%N</code>, verbatim):</p>
