y"><div class="news-result-meta"><span>Release source record</span><span class="news-status proved">Proved in Lean</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Open problem</p><h3>Effective resistance is the optimal finite-graph moving particle constant</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>J. P. Chen, <em>The moving particle lemma for the exclusion process on a weighted graph</em>, Electron. Commun. Probab. 22 (2017), paper 47, arXiv:1606.01577v4, §1, <code>OctopusMoving_v3.tex</code>, lines 177–179, states:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>However, it is unclear in general when \eqref{Reffinf} becomes an equality.</p>
