<p><code>Antitone</code> means weakly decreasing, so repeated entries are allowed. The $n&gt;1$ condition expresses the source ratio $1/n\in(0,1)$. There is no primitive, gcd-one, normalization or distinct-coefficient hypothesis.</p>
