<li><strong>The subspace:</strong> $\mathcal H_{\mathcal I}\subset(\mathbb C^d)^{\otimes3}$ is spanned by $\phi_n=(\bar z_d\sum_i|ini\rangle+z_d\sum_i|iin\rangle)/\sqrt{d+1}$ with $z_d=\tfrac12(1+i\sqrt{(d+1)/(d-1)})$.</li>
<li><strong>The geometric measure:</strong> $G(\psi)=1-\max|\langle abc|\psi\rangle|^2$ over unit product vectors.</li>
</ul>
<p>The definitions are quoted in <a href="../Library/QuantumContext/denkerimaiguhne2025chiral.md">the literature note</a>.</p>
<p>Issue <a href="https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/issues/20037">#20037</a> fixes the reading: for every $d\ge2$ and every unit vector of either subspace, $G=1-d^2/((d^2-1)(d+1))$. This is proved.</p>
