<p>The equivalence is $E_N(U)=D_N(U)$, where Eq. (1) maximizes the generalized geometric measure over fully separable inputs, Eq. (2) defines $D_N(U)=E_N(U^\dagger)$, and Appendix A.1 defines the generalized geometric measure by overlap with non-genuinely multipartite entangled pure states.</p>
