<p>The full-quantifier reading is: for every positive natural <code>n</code>, define
<code>rowSum(n) = Sum_{i=1..n} Sum_{k=1..n} gcd(i,n)/gcd(gcd(i,k),n)</code>; then</p>
<p><code>rowSum(n) = Sum_{d|n} d*phi(d) * (Sum_{e|(n/d)} e*phi(e))</code>.</p>
<p>Here <code>phi</code> is Euler's totient, A002618(n) is <code>n*phi(n)</code>, and A057660(n)
