<code>gcd(gcd(i,k),n) = gcd(gcd(i,n),k)</code> shows the denominator of each row
summand divides its numerator; these are exact natural quotients. For each
<code>d|n</code> the complementary quotient <code>n/d</code> is also exact. Only the quoted
row-sum formula is settled. The <code>%C</code> conjecture for an arbitrary arithmetic
function <code>f</code> is outside this claim.</p>
