atement prose"><p>M. Bathory, <em>Commutator calculus and symbolic differentiation of matrix functions</em> (2025 preprint; SIAM J. Matrix Anal. Appl., 2026), arXiv:2505.07987v3, Conjecture 3.7. The following is the verbatim TeX text of <code>cc_arxiv_1_.tex</code>, line 506 (conjecture environment at lines 505–507), MD5 <code>3f5e6f983ebd4bc8e0036ae4a4b880db</code>:</p>
