<blockquote>
<p>Conjectures: a(3*n) == A382319(n) (mod 3) for n &gt;= 0; a(3*n+1) == 0 (mod 3) and a(3*n+2) == 0 (mod 3) for n &gt;= 1.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>The source equations are $A=X+L(A)^3$ and $B=X(1-X)^{-1}+L(B^3)$,
where $L(F)=\sum_{k\ge1}F(X^k)$ and both series have zero constant term.
At degree $m$, $L(F)$ has coefficient $\sum_{1\le k\le m,\ k\mid m}[X^{m/k}]F$.
The empty degree-zero sum is zero. The cube in the second equation is taken
before Lambert summation. The source is recorded in the
<a href="../Library/RecurrenceComposition/hanna2025a382318.md">Library note</a>.
Preregistration: <a href="https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/issues/18861">#18861</a>.</p>
