ullwood-wu-2026-three-weight-bayesian-inverse"><div class="news-result-meta"><span>Release source record</span><span class="news-status proved">Proved in Lean</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Open problem</p><h3>Three-weight Pauli channels have Bayesian inverses only at the maximally mixed state</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>O. Ting, J. Fullwood and Z. Wu, <em>Operational time-reversal symmetry for unital
