ing the printed superscripts):</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Definition 16. For a given set M ⊂ N define a sequence δⁿ(M) of sets recursively by δ⁰(M) := M, δ(M) := δ¹(M) := M \ S(M), δⁿ⁺¹(M) := δ(δⁿ(M)) and let ηⁿ(M) := |S(δⁿ(M))|, η(M) := η¹(M).</p>
