<p>Consider pairs (x,y) of numbers where sum(p|x) p + sum(q|y) q = x<em>sum(p|x) 1/p + y</em>sum(q|y) 1/q where p, q are primes and sum(p|x) p &gt; sum(q|y) q.</p>
