<code>∀ x y : ℕ, IsPair x y → 1 &lt; x → ¬ Nat.Prime x → 6 ∣ x</code>.</p>
<p>The prime/composite alternation sentence is not claimed. The separate remark
<code>a(2n) &lt; a(2n+2)</code> is also not claimed; the 2015 b-file already refutes it at
<code>a(6552) = a(6554) = 35407</code>.</p>
