<p>Based on the above result, we propose the following conjecture: There exist unitary operators U_A ∈ U(H_A), U_B ∈ U(H_B) and U_AB ∈ U(H_A ⊗ H_B) such that S(U_AB ρ_AB U_AB† ‖ σ_AB) ⩾ S(U_A ρ_A U_A† ‖ σ_A) + S(U_B ρ_B U_B† ‖ σ_B), (4.2) where the reference state σ_AB is required to be full-ranked state. Indeed, our numerical calculations show that inequality (4.2) is true.</p>
