<blockquote>
<p>We conjecture that such a projective measurement which maximizes \eqref{eq:estimation-of-overlapII}
has the following form:</p>
<p>Measure the first qudit in the computational basis.</p>
<p>If $ x \neq 0 $ is measured, do nothing.
