</blockquote>
<p>Here $d_T(\rho,\sigma)=\frac12|\rho^{T_B}-\sigma^{T_B}|_1$ is the partial
transpose distance, $N(\rho)=\frac12(|\rho^{T_B}|<em>1-1)$ is the negativity,
