els.</p></div><details class="verification-details"><summary>Verification details</summary><article class="news-result" id="wilde-2020-coherent-discrimination-triangle-refutation"><div class="news-result-meta"><span>Release source record</span><span class="news-status refuted">Refuted in Lean</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Open problem</p><h3>The coherent discrimination bias is not a metric on quantum channels</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>M. M. Wilde, <em>Coherent Quantum Channel Discrimination</em> (IEEE ISIT 2020; arXiv:2001.02668), introduces a coherent version of channel discrimination.</p>
