<p>The quotation is from the downloaded v2 TeX, <code>main.tex</code>, md5 <code>230ee16b992b9567441d518d7471253e</code>; the trailing TeX comment is omitted. The source's noise model is in §2.2, lines 186–194, and its entropy and coherent-information definitions are in §2.3, lines 201–216. See also <a href="../Library/QuantumContext/sajjadkaurgoodenoughtowsleyguha2026noisygraph.md">the literature note</a>.</p>
