ss="verification-details"><summary>Verification details</summary><article class="news-result" id="onnis-2022-square-three-step-refutation"><div class="news-result-meta"><span>Release source record</span><span class="news-status refuted">Refuted in Lean</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">arXiv</p><h3>Refutation of Onnis&#x27;s square convergence prohibition</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>Luca Onnis, <em>On a variant of the happy numbers and their generalizations</em>,
