    (∀ n : ℕ, 1 ≤ n → n &lt; 33 →
      ∀ G : SimpleGraph (Fin n), G.Connected →
        ∑ S ∈ domSets G, (-4 : ℤ) ^ S.card ≠ 0)
</code></pre>
<p>Here domSets is DominatingSetAverage.domSets. The designated result is
literally &quot;theorem result : ¬ claim&quot;, with no parameters or extra hypotheses.
