$\exists n\ge1,\ L(D(n))&gt;M(n)+1$.</p>
<p>The closed <code>claim</code> is the universal negative answer
$\forall n\ge1,\ L(D(n))\le M(n)+1$.
Karttunen asked the existence question; he did not assert this bound.
<code>result : Not claim</code> answers the original question positively.</p>
