<p>The question extends Corollary 2.6 to every prescribed split $p\in[0,1]$. The answer is affirmative. The construction has $-9\le a_n-8n\le15$, so $a_n=8n+O(1)$, and its zero-label count $C_N$ satisfies $0\le pN-C_N&lt;5$.</p>
