<blockquote>
<p>Therefore, we conjecture that the improved upper bound has the form
$\big\langle E_{l_1}\big(|\hat{\phi}<em>{pq}^{AB}\rangle\big)\big\rangle
\le \frac{E</em>{l_1}(|\xi\rangle_{AC})E_{l_1}(|\eta\rangle_{C'B})}{d-1}.$</p>
