</blockquote>
<p>Here $\zeta,\zeta_\perp$ are the images of $(\psi\pm\psi_\perp)/\sqrt2$ under the
encoding unitary, so the optimized pair is
$\xi=(\zeta+\zeta_\perp)/\sqrt2$, $\xi_\perp=(\zeta-\zeta_\perp)/\sqrt2$.</p>
