<p>Issue <a href="https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/issues/18028">#18028</a> fixes the reading: Eq. (8) holds for every N ≥ 3, every stationary network with bidirectional support and a positive flux, and all observables with D_a D_b &gt; 0. This conjecture is refuted.</p>
