ticle class="news-result" id="meer-weeks-2024-bounded-kurtosis-limit-refutation"><div class="news-result-meta"><span>Release source record</span><span class="news-status refuted">Refuted in Lean</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Open problem</p><h3>A three-point law exceeds the Meer–Weeks two-sided kurtosis upper limit</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>David J. Meer and Eric R. Weeks, <em>Bounded distributions place limits on skewness and larger moments</em>, PLOS ONE 19, e0297862 (2024), DOI 10.1371/journal.pone.0297862; arXiv:2308.05006v2, subsection “Kurtosis $D_4$”, <code>plos_latex_template.tex</code>, line 467:</p>
