<blockquote>
<p>Therefore, the closest separable state to a $q$-symmetric state for two qubits is also $q$-symmetric. If we conjecture that a similar relation holds for arbitrary $q$-Dicke states, it would mean that we can construct whole new families of states whose multipartite entanglement has an analytic expression.</p>
