<p>The vector embedding and the diagonal set both live in <code>EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin 3)</code>.
The local distance step in <code>result</code> applies <code>Metric.infDist_zero_of_mem</code> with
range witness <code>t = 1/2</code>.</p>
