imum single-party entropy need not decrease on average under LOCC</h3><div class="result-statement prose"><p>Y. Guo and Z.-X. Jin, <em>Measure of entanglement and the monogamy relation: a topical review</em>, arXiv:2512.21992v1, Section 9.4, p. 88, state:</p>
