<p>Equation (189) defines $E'^{(n)}(|\psi\rangle)=\max_i h(\rho^{A_i})$, and Table 16 includes the von Neumann entropy $h=S$. Section 2 defines $S(\rho)=-\operatorname{Tr}(\rho\log_2\rho)$. The settlement refutes the unrestricted entropy assertion using four parties of local dimension nine and one two-outcome local projective measurement.</p>
