$$</p>
<p>where $m,M$ are the extreme eigenvalues of $\sigma^{-1/2}\rho\sigma^{-1/2}$. Preregistration: <a href="https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/issues/19943">#19943</a>.</p>
