</blockquote>
<blockquote>
<p>(3) If m&gt;=38 is a term of this sequence, then sigma(4,m) is congruent to
17 + m/2 modulo m.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Here <code>sigma(k,m)</code> is the sum of the <code>k</code>-th powers of the positive divisors
