explicit:</p>
<pre><code class="language-lean">def membership (m : Nat) : Prop :=
  2 | m /\ ArithmeticFunction.sigma 1 m % m = 3 + m / 2
</code></pre>
<p>Natural-number division is used throughout. The closed <code>claim</code> is the
disjunction of the three displayed universal statements, so <code>Not claim</code>
asserts that every one of the three conjectures is false.</p>
