<p>These are verbatim TeX quotations from <code>depths.tex</code>, line 2437 and lines 2445–2447, respectively, in the v3 source archive (MD5 <code>bbacd570d915c7fdda31d547fe476fec</code>). The source macros <code>\field{N}</code> and <code>\Dim_d</code> denote $\mathbb N$ and $\operatorname{Dim}_d$.</p>
